Auto-classifies every incoming lead into one of 6 personas from
docs/customer-personas.md based on form signals (goals, grade,
source, keywords).

- src/lib/persona.ts: Classifier with 6 personas + metadata
  (labels, colors, priority, recommendations)
- captureLeadAction: Classifies at capture time and stores
  persona, persona_confidence, persona_signals in leads table
- LeadRecord type: Added optional persona fields
- LeadKanban: Per-lead persona badge with color coding

Requires migration 00046_lead_personas.sql (already applied
in Supabase — persona/confidence/signals columns exist).

